<title>USA: St Paul hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts</p>
<p>compared with Monday, were $0.50 higher. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     220-250 lbs   58.00</p>
<p>		   250-260 lbs   57.50-58.00</p>
<p>		   260-270 lbs   56.50-57.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3     270-280 lbs   55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-450 lbs   48.00-48.50</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs   49.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs   50.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3     550-700 lbs   51.00</p>
</text>
